1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:04,249
BASE: Nightbird, come in. The launch is at dawn.

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,141
BASE: The pilot won't fly without his tape.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,173
Copy. I'll beat the sun.

4
00:00:27,097 --> 00:00:29,743
BASE: The drawbridge is going up! Turn back!

5
00:00:29,743 --> 00:00:31,693
No time to go around.

6
00:00:42,312 --> 00:00:44,019
Special delivery.

7
00:00:44,019 --> 00:00:46,835
BASE: Tape's aboard. He's playing it now.

8
00:00:50,743 --> 00:00:52,761
Told you I'd beat the sun.
